                        Production WPF applications using MVVM and Prism, including UI-thread marshalling
                        via Dispatcher so background work never blocks or corrupts the interface.
                    </p>
                </article>
                <article class="card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="160">
                    <div class="card-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-branch"></use></svg></div>
